Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":306,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1902013,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":282892,"Name":"FutureMrsVanthof","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282892.jpg?_r=1434622094","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1438858515,"LastPoster":{"Id":284439,"Name":"constancewu","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":22,"Preview":{"Id":1902600,"PostDate":1439690495,"PostContent":"I recommend Sasha Chou Photoraphy. A very talented and friendly photographer. She loves to tavel....","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"constancewu0168@gmail.com","IpAddress":"158.222.240.197","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1439688283,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"constancewu","Id":284439,"Name":"constancewu","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.67.2.225","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f61f5829726fafdbed415d484da53b24","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Brides!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am looking for any help you may have for a great photographer in Punta Cana .. that is reasonably priced .. and when i say that .. i mean. . no more than $2000 for a decent package (7+ hours of coverage) .. i feel like when looking at the prices of photographers my budget is low .. but considering my wedding is costing $3000 alone .. i don&#039;t have much room left for the photographers!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am from Canada, and I hate that all these prices are in USD!! It kills me .. are there any photographers, other than Photo Phil, that charge in CAD??&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I love Karina Jensen&#039;s style .. her prices aren&#039;t too bad .. but i just wanted to check and see if any brides found someone with the same style, but less $$&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902013,"PostDate":1438858515,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Brides!<\/p>\n<p>I am looking for any help you may have for a great photographer in Punta Cana .. that is reasonably priced .. and when i say that .. i mean. . no more than $2000 for a decent package (7+ hours of coverage) .. i feel like when looking at the prices of photographers my budget is low .. but considering my wedding is costing $3000 alone .. i don't have much room left for the photographers!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am from Canada, and I hate that all these prices are in USD!! It kills me .. are there any photographers, other than Photo Phil, that charge in CAD??<\/p>\n<p>I love Karina Jensen's style .. her prices aren't too bad .. but i just wanted to check and see if any brides found someone with the same style, but less $$<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ton_03@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.67.2.225","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430216976,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282892.jpg?_r=1434622094","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsVanthof","Id":282892,"Name":"FutureMrsVanthof","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.58.161.115","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"baab72941cb1db62e712a17de0627b34","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m looking for a photographer too. I really love Katya Nova&#039;s style but I have a feeling they are going to be expensive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902373,"PostDate":1439391966,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm looking for a photographer too. I really love Katya Nova's style but I have a feeling they are going to be expensive.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shanebrittany@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.58.161.115","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1439390645,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284386.jpg?_r=1439406164","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":239,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lilpartyrocker","Id":284386,"Name":"lilpartyrocker","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.115.29.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d3da3cf97c9f6f50ee605cb4cf9525f2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m also looking but finding it hard to stay within budget.. especially with an outside vendor fee of $300!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Katya Nova is amazing! ..but very high and WAY over what I can afford.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Stacey&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902461,"PostDate":1439481091,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm also looking but finding it hard to stay within budget.. especially with an outside vendor fee of $300!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Katya Nova is amazing! ..but very high and WAY over what I can afford.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Stacey<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"StaceyBialek11@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"74.138.180.67","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1377581501,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272956.jpg?_r=1439495518","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Stacer11","Id":272956,"Name":"Stacer11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"158.222.240.197","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"46e99e232c073e67837fed4204af287d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I recommend Sasha Chou Photoraphy. A very talented and friendly photographer. She loves to tavel. I am sure you can discuss good rate with her. Check out her photo. &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/sashachouphotography.tumblr.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/sashachouphotography.tumblr.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;A more affordable way to spend destination wedding is hiring a local vacation photographer instead. You save a lot on travel expenses, hotel expenses and have a LOCAL photogapher to show you around. Check out PicVoyage. A new vacation photography service company. &lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.picvoyage.com\" title=\"External link\"&gt;http:\/\/www.picvoyage.com&lt;\/a&gt; which offers family photos, honeymoon, engagement, elopement and intimate destination photo service. The package is really affordable comapring to a destination wedding photographer. They can also offer local vaaction photo tours experience. I think it is pretty cool idea to save money and also get to tour the city.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902600,"PostDate":1439690495,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I recommend Sasha Chou Photoraphy. A very talented and friendly photographer. She loves to tavel. I am sure you can discuss good rate with her. Check out her photo. <a href='http:\/\/sashachouphotography.tumblr.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/sashachouphot...phy.tumblr.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>A more affordable way to spend destination wedding is hiring a local vacation photographer instead. You save a lot on travel expenses, hotel expenses and have a LOCAL photogapher to show you around. Check out PicVoyage. A new vacation photography service company. <a href='http:\/\/www.picvoyage.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.picvoyage.com<\/a> which offers family photos, honeymoon, engagement, elopement and intimate destination photo service. The package is really affordable comapring to a destination wedding photographer. They can also offer local vaaction photo tours experience. I think it is pretty cool idea to save money and also get to tour the city.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"constancewu0168@gmail.com","IpAddress":"158.222.240.197","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1439688283,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"constancewu","Id":284439,"Name":"constancewu","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79472","Title":"Punta Cana - Photographer","LastPostDate":1439690495},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
