>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137209820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":388,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e30568e124fab526756dd2cf858ac1c8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; thank you&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1239370,"PostDate":1280662063,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> thank you<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rachel_gerber@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1276858619,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229307.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Rachel&Chris2011","Id":229307,"Name":"Rachel&Chris2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":388,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"185fdf69b66f286b223e13ad5b136b64","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I can suggest Mexico as an exotic and not too expensive destination wedding, right now the most popular places as DW are Cancun and Puerto Vallarta\/Riviera Nayarit. If you want to save money the Pacific coast is cheaper than Cancun but both venues have a very good options for weddings, if you are planning a DW the beach is a great option, there are many Resorts that offer wedding packages and very good deals, I can say that&amp;nbsp;for Puerto Vallarta and Rivieran Nayarit which are together in the Banderas Bay. In the Riviera Nayarit you can find Nuevo Vallarta and Punta de Mita which are the newest developments in the zone. All inclusive Resorts have very good packages and you can be stress free becasue they always offer a wedding planner who take care of everything even when you are so far.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Hope this information helps!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" height=\"16\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"16\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1261636,"PostDate":1282393640,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I can suggest Mexico as an exotic and not too expensive destination wedding, right now the most popular places as DW are Cancun and Puerto Vallarta\/Riviera Nayarit. If you want to save money the Pacific coast is cheaper than Cancun but both venues have a very good options for weddings, if you are planning a DW the beach is a great option, there are many Resorts that offer wedding packages and very good deals, I can say that\u00a0for Puerto Vallarta and Rivieran Nayarit which are together in the Banderas Bay. In the Riviera Nayarit you can find Nuevo Vallarta and Punta de Mita which are the newest developments in the zone. All inclusive Resorts have very good packages and you can be stress free becasue they always offer a wedding planner who take care of everything even when you are so far.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hope this information helps!<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"16\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"16\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"weddings.vallarta@fiestahotelgroup.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275587511,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228822.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lorenaponce","Id":228822,"Name":"lorenaponce","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":388,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9af9e51d59724af4fc4cdbd80093e67f","RawContent":"Cebu and other Asian islands are also off the beaten path paradises!","Attachments":[],"Id":1309200,"PostDate":1286765119,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Cebu and other Asian islands are also off the beaten path paradises!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"msjesslee@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1243272370,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217811.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":119,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"msjesslee","Id":217811,"Name":"msjesslee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.205.241.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":388,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f926d4fbe3edf8fc6b135ebc8f923a4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;d say go with Mexico or somewhere else exotic if you&#039;re going to get people to travel anyway - might as well bve to a super fun and beautiful place!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1842595,"PostDate":1396619475,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'd say go with Mexico or somewhere else exotic if you're going to get people to travel anyway - might as well bve to a super fun and beautiful place!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bluestarfish@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.78.214.142","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396219243,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Kyliewylie","Id":277410,"Name":"Kyliewylie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.36.235.231","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":388,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a3f6ff1e0d3a9af985cf092c3a4ef3e8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Great article!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848152,"PostDate":1399154242,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Great article!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"letitia_leaks@verizon.net","IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397052122,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsGlover","Id":277534,"Name":"FutureMrsGlover","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.63.242.236","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":388,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"Ed