ersonal wedding website. Some of them are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1. Add videos and photos in cool scrapbooks and slideshows easily&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2. Show maps, RSVP, meal selection and childcare info&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3. Have website guests sign a guestbook and print it later&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;4.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px;\"&gt;Impress your friends with your own domain&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px;\"&gt;5. Customer service aspect&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px;\"&gt;6. Guest bios&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px;\"&gt;7. Blogs&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px;\"&gt;8. &amp;nbsp;Seating Chart&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896735,"PostDate":1432176289,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>There are many benefits to choose a \u00a0personal wedding website. Some of them are:\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1. Add videos and photos in cool scrapbooks and slideshows easily<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>