e south of Puerto Vallarta, where guests arrive only by boat (so talk about a vacation experience for your wedding!)\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\">If you want to find out more about our packages feel free to go to our website\u00a0www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com \u00a0where you will be able to see more about Las Caletas, a beautiful and exotic beach location, perfect for a destination Wedding, with the support of our great wedding coordinators staff.<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\">Best of luck finding the perfect venue!<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79107-all\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/sml_gallery_258213_17896_13408.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='All'  width='200' height='134'  alt='All' id='sml_image_view_79107' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81801-white-pink-and-rustic-ceremony\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/sml_gallery_258213_18083_4291773.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='White, pink and rustic ceremony'  width='200' height='134'  alt='White, pink and rustic ceremony' id='sml_image_view_81801' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81814-table-setup-idea\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_10944\/sml_gallery_258213_10944_479229.jpg' class='galatta