{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":201,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1901727,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284131,"Name":"MegLeLy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1438618894,"LastPoster":{"Id":284131,"Name":"MegLeLy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1901727,"PostDate":1438618894,"PostContent":"So I'm completely overwhelmed by the choices of where... Nothing seems to be falling together to...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megewy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.17.41.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437866879,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MegLeLy","Id":284131,"Name":"MegLeLy","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.17.41.18","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79459,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9d61ed8ecf5ee41e72c3d3d857810d93","RawContent":"So I&#039;m completely overwhelmed by the choices of where... Nothing seems to be falling together to be the place for our wedding.  \n\nIf any of you ladies could help me out that would be great! \n\nLooking for a place with:\n\n-good scuba diving\n\n- amazing beach\n\n- kids club - baby club would be even better but not mandatory\n\n- can&#039;t be a beaches resort (too expensive)\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1901727,"PostDate":1438618894,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So I'm completely overwhelmed by the choices of where... Nothing seems to be falling together to be the place for our wedding.  <br>\nIf any of you ladies could help me out that would be great! <br>\nLooking for a place with:<br>\n-good scuba diving<br>\n- amazing beach<br>\n- kids club - baby club would be even better but not mandatory<br>\n- can't be a beaches resort (too expensive)<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megewy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.17.41.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437866879,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MegLeLy","Id":284131,"Name":"MegLeLy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.39.175","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79459,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"72028b3e87d76903566c3a5bee0006e6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community where you&#039;ll find lots of great resources to help you out with your planning decisions, MegLeLy, and Congrats on your dw!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have you looked at the Barcelo resorts? here are some images to help you visualize what a backdrop they&#039;d make for your Big Day......enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153183986224487.1073741926.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Barcelo Colonial Resort Wedding Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/10993119_10153183999204487_2023275987318484661_o.jpg\" alt=\"10993119_10153183999204487_2023275987318\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....or these from another &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153071564624487.1073741920.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Barcelo Colonial Wedding Album 2:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpt1\/t31.0-8\/10865748_10153071584314487_8458616125558124571_o.jpg\" alt=\"10865748_10153071584314487_8458616125558\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10981365_10153071586274487_4291382981577465521_o.jpg\" alt=\"10981365_10153071586274487_4291382981577\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....and this from the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152425657474487.1073741892.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Barcelo Maya Palace Wedding Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/10255392_10152425667234487_3874374495359305532_o.jpg\" alt=\"10255392_10152425667234487_3874374495359\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope you find the perfect place for your Wedding Day Celebration - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901736,"PostDate":1438622163,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community where you'll find lots of great resources to help you out with your planning decisions, MegLeLy, and Congrats on your dw!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have you looked at the Barcelo resorts? here are some images to help you visualize what a backdrop they'd make for your Big Day......enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from the <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153183986224487.1073741926.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Barcelo Colonial Resort Wedding Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/10993119_10153183999204487_2023275987318484661_o.jpg\" alt=\"10993119_10153183999204487_2023275987318\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....or these from another <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153071564624487.1073741920.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Barcelo Colonial Wedding Album 2:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpt1\/t31.0-8\/10865748_10153071584314487_8458616125558124571_o.jpg\" alt=\"10865748_10153071584314487_8458616125558\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10981365_10153071586274487_4291382981577465521_o.jpg\" alt=\"10981365_10153071586274487_4291382981577\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....and this from the <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152425657474487.1073741892.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Barcelo Maya Palace Wedding Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/10255392_10152425667234487_3874374495359305532_o.jpg\" alt=\"10255392_10152425667234487_3874374495359\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope you find the perfect place for your Wedding Day Celebration - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79459,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9df460f8c825d3c85e0813eb2644a988","RawContent":"[quote name=\"MegLeLy\" post=\"1901727\" timestamp=\"1438615294\"]\nSo I&#039;m completely overwhelmed by the choices of where... Nothing seems to be falling together to be the place for our wedding.\nIf any of you ladies could help me out that would be great!\nLooking for a place with:\n-good scuba diving\n- amazing beach\n- kids club - baby club would be even better but not mandatory\n- can&#039;t be a beaches resort (too expensive)\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]@[member=\"MegLeLy\"],\n\nHave you considered The Riviera maya area? especially because everything here is close to each other.\n\nHappy Planning\nJoyce","Attachments":[],"Id":1901809,"PostDate":1438709823,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>MegLeLy, on 03 August 2015 - 08:21 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>So I'm completely overwhelmed by the choices of where... Nothing seems to be falling together to be the place for our wedding.<br>\nIf any of you ladies could help me out that would be great!<br>\nLooking for a place with:<br>\n-good scuba diving<br>\n- amazing beach<br>\n- kids club - baby club would be even better but not mandatory<br>\n- can't be a beaches resort (too expensive)<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284131\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284131-meglely\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MegLeLy<\/span><\/a>,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have you considered The Riviera maya area? especially because everything here is close to each other.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning<\/p>\n<p>Joyce<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html'>http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1326857987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.137.136.45","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79459,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"29a464f644920d7ddd11cb974dd6ea31","RawContent":"@[member=\"dreamweddings\"]\n\nLooking there, and Cozumel right now.  \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1901840,"PostDate":1438736431,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"250090\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/250090-dreamweddings\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">dreamweddings<\/span><\/a><br>\nLooking there, and Cozumel right now.  <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megewy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.17.41.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437866879,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MegLeLy","Id":284131,"Name":"MegLeLy","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79459","Title":"Help Deciding Where!","LastPostDate":1438736431},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
