ista Suite at Mandalay Bay. I wanted to have a in-suite reception at one of those locations. Please give me some ideas and price information for May 2013 if possible.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;lt;3 Thanks&amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1702181,"PostDate":1357604662,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi, I wanted to know if anyone had an in-suite reception in the Cosmopolitan Wraparound terrace suite , Media-suite \u00a0\/ Vista Suite at Mandalay Bay. I wanted to have a in-suite reception at one of those locations. Please give me some ideas and price information for May 2013 if possible.\u00a0<\/p> <p> <3 Thanks<3<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"prettybates@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357603984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264025.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tramella","Id":264025,"Name":"Tramella","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71650,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e179f2253b52e58911b66c83c8a86ec1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I have the same request. I am looking at both of these options for my Oct 31st wedding.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1715767,"PostDate":1360000327,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I have the same request. I am looking at both of these options for my Oct 31st wedding.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"daretwobe@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1360000271,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265634.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"yinkanut","Id":265634,"Name":"yinkanut","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71650,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"33c276cbd5807e46938c29c34371ba61","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I contacted the Cosmo and was told by one of their consultants that the wrap-around terrace suite would only fit 12 people for a reception. I fell in love with the idea of a reception in one of their suites, but the menu they provided is faaaaarrrrr to expensive for my budget. :( Any ideas for hotels that will let you self-cater and DIY receptions in their suites?\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1763346,"PostDate":1370104663,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I contacted the Cosmo and was told by one of their consultants that the wrap-around terrace suite would only fit 12 people for a reception. I fell in love with the idea of a reception in one of their suites, but the menu they provided is faaaaarrrrr to expensive for my budget. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> Any ideas for hotels that will let you self-cater and DIY receptions in their suites?<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"juanitambishop@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1369157731,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269813.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"juanitambishop","Id":269813,"Name":"juanitambishop","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71650,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b2e6278e20b41ab55a2916c19c40c5f9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We had a PH suite at the Mirage and it was just the 2 of us...but it would totally be big enough for a reception! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1802904,"PostDate":1380207112,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: He