Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1933,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1528709,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":246122,"Name":"darlakay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246122.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1317608889,"LastPoster":{"Id":270829,"Name":"andymiller","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270829.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":31,"Preview":{"Id":1771324,"PostDate":1371885980,"PostContent":"If you're searching for a wedding venue and a reception all in one place, I could recommend Denn...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"iamandym@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1371885659,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270829.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"andymiller","Id":270829,"Name":"andymiller","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63855,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1edeaf1dd1e5c54bfbda5c836d95170f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We are planning an in suite wedding at the Cosmopolitan and using Scenic Las Vegas Weddings. We are looking into different options as&amp;nbsp;far as a reception.&amp;nbsp; I would like to hear from someone who has actually had their wedding there. We like to know of a good caterer or restaurant to use.&amp;nbsp; Has anyone ever been to Casa Di Amore?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1528709,"PostDate":1317608889,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We are planning an in suite wedding at the Cosmopolitan and using Scenic Las Vegas Weddings. We are looking into different options as\u00a0far as a reception.\u00a0 I would like to hear from someone who has actually had their wedding there. We like to know of a good caterer or restaurant to use.\u00a0 Has anyone ever been to Casa Di Amore?\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"darlakay@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1317608142,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246122.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"darlakay","Id":246122,"Name":"darlakay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63855,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9a93a15c82438caf454c4237974c6cb3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; There are a ton of restaurants in that area, not just in Cosmo. CityCenter has a ton inside ARIA, Mandarin Oriental and Crystals, the mall. Then there are the hotels nearby...\n \n What kind of food or mood do you want and how many people? I&#039;d start there, then break it down into budget. I did a pre-wedding meet and greet at Todd English PUB and it went really well, but it&#039;s not exactly intimate or quiet. :) I did my actual reception at Border Grill at Mandalay and then did an afterparty in a suite catered with snacks and cake from Whole Foods and with a bartender from Culinary Pros Las Vegas, and they were great.\n \n So many options!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1642017,"PostDate":1342486014,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> There are a ton of restaurants in that area, not just in Cosmo. CityCenter has a ton inside ARIA, Mandarin Oriental and Crystals, the mall. Then there are the hotels nearby...<br \/> <br \/> What kind of food or mood do you want and how many people? I'd start there, then break it down into budget. I did a pre-wedding meet and greet at Todd English PUB and it went really well, but it's not exactly intimate or quiet. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I did my actual reception at Border Grill at Mandalay and then did an afterparty in a suite catered with snacks and cake from Whole Foods and with a bartender from Culinary Pros Las Vegas, and they were great.<br \/> <br \/> So many options!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"littlevegaswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1342485296,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257951.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lilvegaswed","Id":257951,"Name":"lilvegaswed","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63855,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4934b053532d04c8b2912530453033c8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; @lilvegaswed was it hard to get an outside caterer into the Mandalay Bay suites?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I wanted to DIY reception in the Vista Suite at Mandalay Bay, just order some pizza or appies, and BYOB, but I&#039;m afraid with their \"no outside food\/drink\" policy that they&#039;ll shut it down.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Did you tell them it was happening, or just snuck it in?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1735583,"PostDate":1363706749,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> @lilvegaswed was it hard to get an outside caterer into the Mandalay Bay suites?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I wanted to DIY reception in the Vista Suite at Mandalay Bay, just order some pizza or appies, and BYOB, but I'm afraid with their \"no outside food\/drink\" policy that they'll shut it down.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Did you tell them it was happening, or just snuck it in?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chipper_spice@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363706637,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267542.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lwells27","Id":267542,"Name":"lwells27","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63855,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2291e61b2baef0b840f09e4a7b9bc511","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; If you&#039;re searching for a wedding venue and a reception all in one place, I could recommend &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/personalmoneynetwork.com\/moneyblog\/2012\/08\/10\/dennys-wedding-chapel\/\"&gt;Denny&#039;s&lt;\/a&gt;. Yes, Denny\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s, which has opened a flagship restaurant, complete with a wedding chapel, on Fremont Street. The Denny&#039;s Wedding Chapel is officially open for business, hosting its first bar and grill-themed wedding.\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1771324,"PostDate":1371885980,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> If you're searching for a wedding venue and a reception all in one place, I could recommend <a href='http:\/\/personalmoneynetwork.com\/moneyblog\/2012\/08\/10\/dennys-wedding-chapel\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Denny's<\/a>. Yes, Denny\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s, which has opened a flagship restaurant, complete with a wedding chapel, on Fremont Street. The Denny's Wedding Chapel is officially open for business, hosting its first bar and grill-themed wedding.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"iamandym@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1371885659,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270829.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"andymiller","Id":270829,"Name":"andymiller","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"63855","Title":"Need Dinner Wedding Reception ideas for  Las Vegas","LastPostDate":1371885980},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
