Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"557a90c2c82376bb430ed18ed13c35d9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hopefully, you will have a limo that the casinos will let stand in the limo area for a while when you \"jump out\" to take photos. I&#039;m local to Vegas and have done the strip wedding photos with a limo and it wasn&#039;t easy.&amp;nbsp; The limos are not allowed to wait around especially on weekends.&amp;nbsp; So you need an experienced limo driver specifically for this.&amp;nbsp; You definitely can&#039;t do it on your own.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;ve worked at a wedding chapel and have visited almost of them here in Vegas.&amp;nbsp; If anyone needs information or advice let me know.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ll help if I can.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I also had a disaster at the first chapel I was married in.&amp;nbsp; So I&#039;m renewing on July 4 this year. If you need a minister or photographer I&#039;ll let you know how they did for me.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1435617,"PostDate":1302931278,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hopefully, you will have a limo that the casinos will let stand in the limo area for a while when you \"jump out\" to take photos. I'm local to Vegas and have done the strip wedding photos with a limo and it wasn't easy.\u00a0 The limos are not allowed to wait around especially on weekends.\u00a0 So you need an experienced limo driver specifically for this.\u00a0 You definitely can't do it on your own.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I've worked at a wedding chapel and have visited almost of them here in Vegas.\u00a0 If anyone needs information or advice let me know.\u00a0 I'll help if I can.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I also had a disaster at the first chapel I was married in.\u00a0 So I'm renewing on July 4 this year. If you need a minister or photographer I'll let you know how they did for me.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>'Gra geal mo chroi'<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"misskim_red@msn.com","IpAddress":"72.193.165.99","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1215716891,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210452.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"misskim_red@msn.com","Id":210452,"Name":"misskim_red@msn.com","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1f4c2b5e8e7ab18496e370cb3baebf97","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; If you looking for a photographer &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.it-neues.de\/blog\/?p=556\"&gt;Patrick Kuschfeld Photography&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; He was our photographer in Vegas for one day. I guess you can right him an mail.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1481769,"PostDate":1309966128,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> If you looking for a photographer <a href='http:\/\/www.it-neues.de\/blog\/?p=556' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Patrick Kuschfeld Photography<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> He was our photographer in Vegas for one day. I guess you can right him an mail.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"patrick.kuschfeld@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1309964250,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242006.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Ryan-Joel","Id":242006,"Name":"Ryan-Joel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b0581cdc1fcf7798cffee3f7ad235a0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi LV Brides!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We&#039;re getting married 7.21.12 at The Luxor! We live in Illinois and FI has been to Vegas before, but I haven&#039;t. I can not wait until all of my planning and working hard on DIY projects finally comes together!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 6 months to go &amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1571841,"PostDate":1327300826,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi LV Brides!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We're getting married 7.21.12 at The Luxor! We live in Illinois and FI has been to Vegas before, but I haven't. I can not wait until all of my planning and working hard on DIY projects finally comes together!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> 6 months to go <3<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aquamarinw792004@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1327297409,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250360.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissyB313","Id":250360,"Name":"MissyB313","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"586c3351e2a7639fcffde51ca72843b7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We are looking at getting married in the Spring of 2013- possibly at the MGM. Any suggestions????&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1573060,"PostDate":1327521898,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We are looking at getting married in the Spring of 2013- possibly at the MGM. Any suggestions????<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"trumpy82@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1319568658,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247060.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"trumpy82","Id":247060,"Name":"trumpy82","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"deee83e501a5d8b0449d77221d8e5be1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m getting married at the Wynn on 7.21.12.&amp;nbsp; Wedding planning in full swing now!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1573153,"PostDate":1327527161,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm getting married at the Wynn on 7.21.12.\u00a0 Wedding planning in full swing now!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lacroucher@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1314380375,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-244413.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":113,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lpetican","Id":244413,"Name":"lpetican","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"335b49ba6afe714474dda547d96c4ebb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey MissyB313,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My name is Daniel Benitez and I am a professional wedding videographer. Because you are having a destination wedding, I understand that not all your family will be able to make it. What better way to share your special day with ALL of your friends and family than invest in a professional videographer!?!?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Please take a few minutes to look at my website and my sample video.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Daniel Benitez&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; -Manager &amp;amp; Videographer&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Brandedfilmsonline.com&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Brandedfilmsonline@gmail.com&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; (425) 829 8309&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1573156,"PostDate":1327527575,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey MissyB313,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My name is Daniel Benitez and I am a professional wedding videographer. Because you are having a destination wedding, I understand that not all your family will be able to make it. What better way to share your special day with ALL of your friends and family than invest in a professional videographer!?!?\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Please take a few minutes to look at my website and my sample video.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Daniel Benitez<\/p> <p> -Manager & Videographer<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Brandedfilmsonline.com<\/p> <p> Brandedfilmsonline@gmail.com<\/p> <p> (425) 829 8309<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brandedfilmsonline@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1327526997,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250492.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"brandedfilms","Id":250492,"Name":"brandedfilms","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"00378af21d01d7d9def4c5550dc38e28","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We are getting married 10.12.12 @ A Elvis Chapel, and we are staying at his parents condo at the Tahitian Resort. I am so excited but a little overwhelmed. We&#039;re just having our parents and 4 friends at the actual wedding; but I want to have a reception once we get back home for everyone. I&#039;m trying to come up with an announcement\/Reception invite to send out. I&#039;m pretty muck DIY-ing everything (well as much as I can) and have found a few good websites to help out: pinterest for organization, Off Beat Bride for style ideas.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1576198,"PostDate":1328039056,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We are getting married 10.12.12 @ A Elvis Chapel, and we are staying at his parents condo at the Tahitian Resort. I am so excited but a little overwhelmed. We're just having our parents and 4 friends at the actual wedding; but I want to have a reception once we get back home for everyone. I'm trying to come up with an announcement\/Reception invite to send out. I'm pretty muck DIY-ing everything (well as much as I can) and have found a few good websites to help out: pinterest for organization, Off Beat Bride for style ideas.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"annahj65@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1328038541,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250785.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":101,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Annah Jensen","Id":250785,"Name":"Annah Jensen","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"832ee4e0bf5f4de8a0c338d105afbdc7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We haven&#039;t booked anything yet, but we plan to get married in LV in 2013, at the MGM. &amp;nbsp;Does anyone have any wedding pics from the MGM?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1577608,"PostDate":1328239065,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We haven't booked anything yet, but we plan to get married in LV in 2013, at the MGM. \u00a0Does anyone have any wedding pics from the MGM?\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"trumpy82@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1319568658,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247060.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"trumpy82","Id":247060,"Name":"trumpy82","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fcedd9d602c57dce4428a143f39d63bf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We haven&#039;t booked anything yet, but we plan to get married in LV in 2013, at the MGM. &amp;nbsp;Does anyone have any wedding pics from the MGM?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1577609,"PostDate":1328239101,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We haven't booked anything yet, but we plan to get married in LV in 2013, at the MGM. \u00a0Does anyone have any wedding pics from the MGM?\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"trumpy82@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1319568658,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247060.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"trumpy82","Id":247060,"Name":"trumpy82","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0b8365bff339dc8243e1d65dfe32d542","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi fellow LV brides, our day is coming up so fast.&amp;nbsp; We will be getting married at The Little Chapel of Flowers on July4, 2012.&amp;nbsp; I have just decided to use their gown rental so I won&#039;t have to drag a gown thru the airports.&amp;nbsp; Hoping it turns out right.&amp;nbsp; If anyone comes across reviews or pic for Tux One hit me up please.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595979,"PostDate":1331938712,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi fellow LV brides, our day is coming up so fast.\u00a0 We will be getting married at The Little Chapel of Flowers on July4, 2012.\u00a0 I have just decided to use their gown rental so I won't have to drag a gown thru the airports.\u00a0 Hoping it turns out right.\u00a0 If anyone comes across reviews or pic for Tux One hit me up please.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"therealallbap@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1308715494,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241425.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"allbap","Id":241425,"Name":"allbap","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":146,"TotalPages":15,"CurrentPage":130,"NextPage":140,"PreviousPage":120,"LastPage":140},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
