Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55a2d49d0bf14d9b4d1f5d855e263e07","RawContent":"A friend of mine just got married at the grove!!! very pretty there you can find it online. It&#039;s off of the strip! : ) She rented shuttles for the guests and wedding party.. the reception was at the grove also then we took the shuttles back to the strip!","Attachments":[],"Id":1187068,"PostDate":1276754075,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                A friend of mine just got married at the grove!!! very pretty there you can find it online. It's off of the strip! : ) She rented shuttles for the guests and wedding party.. the reception was at the grove also then we took the shuttles back to the strip!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mdurkin1@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1271617064,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227433.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mdb","Id":227433,"Name":"mdb","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b32f0a02ba423df91b523a4538bdaee","RawContent":"Hey Vegas brides! I already had my DW in Mexico last month and am having my legal wedding in Vegas this Saturday! I wish I had found this thread sooner. I wanted to see if any of you Vegas brides had suggestions on cool pictures? Our 30 guests and I are going to drive around the strip after it&#039;s official and jump out to take fun pictures. I know Vegas sign, Bellagio fountains etc... but not sure where else. \n \n Any suggestions?","Attachments":[],"Id":1191876,"PostDate":1277178035,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Vegas brides! I already had my DW in Mexico last month and am having my legal wedding in Vegas this Saturday! I wish I had found this thread sooner. I wanted to see if any of you Vegas brides had suggestions on cool pictures? Our 30 guests and I are going to drive around the strip after it's official and jump out to take fun pictures. I know Vegas sign, Bellagio fountains etc... but not sure where else. <br \/> <br \/> Any suggestions?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>~ Mmm cupcakes ~<\/span><br \/>\n<span>[url=<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/%5D\">http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/]<\/a><br \/>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;2\/st\/20100919\/e\/Our+Italian+Family+Recept\/dt\/-3\/k\/79dd\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...79dd\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"johnnygirl777@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1219277160,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211300.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":278,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KittenHeart","Id":211300,"Name":"KittenHeart","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b6758dd1d95c6117082cda4e6454ea47","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m getting married in the Valley of Fire on May 14, 2011. We&#039;ve booked with Scenic Las Vegas Weddings for the sunset ceremony. I&#039;m trying to find a good not too expensive company to rent a bus from to get the 40 guests out to the VoF, and am also looking for suggestions on a restaurant to have a reception at either on or close to the strip that would be about $25-30 per person. If anyone has any suggestions please let me know. I&#039;m super stoked for the trip and the wedding. We also plan to take pictures all over the strip after the wedding when we&#039;re all dressed up :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1246229,"PostDate":1281222605,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm getting married in the Valley of Fire on May 14, 2011. We've booked with Scenic Las Vegas Weddings for the sunset ceremony. I'm trying to find a good not too expensive company to rent a bus from to get the 40 guests out to the VoF, and am also looking for suggestions on a restaurant to have a reception at either on or close to the strip that would be about $25-30 per person. If anyone has any suggestions please let me know. I'm super stoked for the trip and the wedding. We also plan to take pictures all over the strip after the wedding when we're all dressed up <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"set_me_free_84@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281221320,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231133.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tami","Id":231133,"Name":"Tami","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"395ae04762ee4300d180f5e4ce40f3a5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m getting married October 15th, 2010 @ one of the Chapels (Las Vegas Weddings). It&#039;s a little different than I originally planned but I think it&#039;s going to be really sweet and alot of fun. Very excited if anyone has any tips on places to eat or things that you just have to do while there please let me know. We&#039;re staying at the Vdara and we&#039;re eloping so it&#039;s going to be a HUGE surprise when we get back.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1249171,"PostDate":1281478650,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm getting married October 15th, 2010 @ one of the Chapels (Las Vegas Weddings). It's a little different than I originally planned but I think it's going to be really sweet and alot of fun. Very excited if anyone has any tips on places to eat or things that you just have to do while there please let me know. We're staying at the Vdara and we're eloping so it's going to be a HUGE surprise when we get back.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"danielle.ayers@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281030025,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231049.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"futuremrsjrj","Id":231049,"Name":"futuremrsjrj","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7cfcc1658da2188a7043aa60f11f85a0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello everyone! :) My name is Sandra.&amp;nbsp; My fiance and I are getting married June 27, 2011 in Las Vegas and couldn&#039;t be more excited about it!! We originally were looking into Hawaii, but decided Vegas would be more ideal for us, our family, and friends.&amp;nbsp; We cannot wait!&amp;nbsp; We are having our ceremony at the Heritage Garden through Always &amp;amp; Forever Weddings.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m currently in the process of looking up hotel and restaurant information... which can be overwhelming at times! Any advice would be helpful :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1254914,"PostDate":1281976311,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello everyone! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> My name is Sandra.\u00a0 My fiance and I are getting married June 27, 2011 in Las Vegas and couldn't be more excited about it!! We originally were looking into Hawaii, but decided Vegas would be more ideal for us, our family, and friends.\u00a0 We cannot wait!\u00a0 We are having our ceremony at the Heritage Garden through Always & Forever Weddings.\u00a0 I'm currently in the process of looking up hotel and restaurant information... which can be overwhelming at times! Any advice would be helpful <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sand2487@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1246688039,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219072.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sand2487","Id":219072,"Name":"sand2487","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c01f6b68b94a1a86276ab1ab22b31aa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 18px\"&gt;Caesar&#039;s Palace ~ May 2011! Can&#039;t wait!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1336927,"PostDate":1289499811,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 18px\">Caesar's Palace ~ May 2011! Can't wait!<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>~*Ben's Babe*~<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"aegz72@mail.umkc.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281627122,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231289.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":168,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KSPrincess","Id":231289,"Name":"KSPrincess","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1807a75a2b5ce9c7db9683477c5b9d88","RawContent":"The legal wedding is next weekend at the little white chapel! DW is in May in Mexico. Just wanted to say hello to fellow Vegas brides. I&#039;m looking forward to my wasabi crusted filet at Tao after- my fave!","Attachments":[],"Id":1386805,"PostDate":1296328544,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                The legal wedding is next weekend at the little white chapel! DW is in May in Mexico. Just wanted to say hello to fellow Vegas brides. I'm looking forward to my wasabi crusted filet at Tao after- my fave!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"staceystegman@comcast.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1264556628,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225078.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sascolo","Id":225078,"Name":"sascolo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6b7c4f2bfbaea8e2eac5708bc6d5a8cd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My name is Jenn. We are getting married at Planet Hollywood on May 22, 2011. Super excited!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Still looking for a casual reasonably priced restaurant for dinner and then we head up to our Panorama suite for the reception.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Would love to hear what others are planning!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; All the best LV brides.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1401923,"PostDate":1298220639,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My name is Jenn. We are getting married at Planet Hollywood on May 22, 2011. Super excited!<\/p> <p> Still looking for a casual reasonably priced restaurant for dinner and then we head up to our Panorama suite for the reception.<\/p> <p> Would love to hear what others are planning!<\/p> <p> All the best LV brides.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jrbeans@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1298214262,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236989.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"VegasBride0511","Id":236989,"Name":"VegasBride0511","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c23bf6158fc04bfadb6411aa375385c2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey Vegas Brides!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are getting married at a chapel (well, their gazebo actually) on The Strip this October! Super excited!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1415553,"PostDate":1299939063,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Vegas Brides!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are getting married at a chapel (well, their gazebo actually) on The Strip this October! Super excited!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k.tuepah@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1299690311,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237602.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KTownKate","Id":237602,"Name":"KTownKate","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dd3ea5408585f19a085da3718909b363","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Meseh;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The grounds at the&amp;nbsp;Flamingo are gorgeous - lots of lush vegetation, beautiful pool areas and private gazebos.&amp;nbsp; The only thing is that there do tend to be a lot of people there milling around looking at all of the animals (yes, there really are flamingos here!) and walking the grounds so you would just have to be ok with people peeking in on your ceremony.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n The Flamingo is one of the older properties on the Strip so the inside itself isn&#039;t quite as \"up-to-date\" as Caesar&#039;s palace, but the wedding package prices are much less expensive and there are more \"extras\" thrown in (i.e. 2 night stays, more photography, etc.) with the packages.&amp;nbsp; There&#039;s also a quaint sense of old-Vegas nostalgia with the Flamingo whereas Caesar&#039;s Palace is a quintessential glitzy Vegas property so it really just depends on your personal preference.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m sure you&#039;ve already checked out both online but for those Brides that might be reading, here are the links:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Caesar&#039;s Wedding Packages:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"display: none\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.caesarspalaceweddings.com\"&gt;www.caesarspalaceweddings.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Flamingo Wedding Packages:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"display: none\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.flamingolasvegas.com\/weddings\/flamingo-las-vegas\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.flamingolasvegas.com\/weddings\/flamingo-las-vegas\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We got married in Vegas last year and WE LOVED IT!&amp;nbsp; Awesome place to tie the knot and all of our guests had a really great time too.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Les&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1424172,"PostDate":1301170721,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Meseh;<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The grounds at the\u00a0Flamingo are gorgeous - lots of lush vegetation, beautiful pool areas and private gazebos.\u00a0 The only thing is that there do tend to be a lot of people there milling around looking at all of the animals (yes, there really are flamingos here!) and walking the grounds so you would just have to be ok with people peeking in on your ceremony.\u00a0<\/p> <p> <br \/> The Flamingo is one of the older properties on the Strip so the inside itself isn't quite as \"up-to-date\" as Caesar's palace, but the wedding package prices are much less expensive and there are more \"extras\" thrown in (i.e. 2 night stays, more photography, etc.) with the packages.\u00a0 There's also a quaint sense of old-Vegas nostalgia with the Flamingo whereas Caesar's Palace is a quintessential glitzy Vegas property so it really just depends on your personal preference.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm sure you've already checked out both online but for those Brides that might be reading, here are the links:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong>Caesar's Wedding Packages:\u00a0<\/strong><span  style=\"display: none\">\u00a0<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.caesarspalaceweddings.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.caesarspalaceweddings.com<\/a><\/p> <p> <strong>Flamingo Wedding Packages:\u00a0<\/strong><span  style=\"display: none\">\u00a0<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.flamingolasvegas.com\/weddings\/flamingo-las-vegas\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.flamingol...ingo-las-vegas\/<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We got married in Vegas last year and WE LOVED IT!\u00a0 Awesome place to tie the knot and all of our guests had a really great time too.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Les<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@planaweddinginvegas.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1301160271,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238196.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":123,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LesTyler","Id":238196,"Name":"LesTyler","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":146,"TotalPages":15,"CurrentPage":120,"NextPage":130,"PreviousPage":110,"LastPage":140},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
