Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2b1e3036eba44edf66698fe08a6ec20a","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;liltanya410&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hello Everyone...\n I am getting married on 4\/10\/2010 at the Cresendo Pool at the Flamingo. We have decided to book a section of the buffet for the reception and then the Fire Side Lounge for drinks after. \n Does anyone have photos from their Flamingo Wedding? I visited the grounds, but am very curious to see what it looks like all set up! \n Viva Las Vegas!!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Flamingo is pretty colorful for weddings...enjoy! post some pics","Attachments":[],"Id":1114790,"PostDate":1271369586,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>liltanya410<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hello Everyone...<br \/> I am getting married on 4\/10\/2010 at the Cresendo Pool at the Flamingo. We have decided to book a section of the buffet for the reception and then the Fire Side Lounge for drinks after. <br \/> Does anyone have photos from their Flamingo Wedding? I visited the grounds, but am very curious to see what it looks like all set up! <br \/> Viva Las Vegas!!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Flamingo is pretty colorful for weddings...enjoy! post some pics\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"weddings@litratophoto.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1250731260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220732.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ronsoliman","Id":220732,"Name":"ronsoliman","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0c9b4abef445a053873a888fcd40c422","RawContent":"Hi Everyone! I&#039;m getting married October 17th, 2010 @ The West Lawn at the Flamingo!","Attachments":[],"Id":1140911,"PostDate":1273184507,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Everyone! I'm getting married October 17th, 2010 @ The West Lawn at the Flamingo!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"imafoxx@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1272599714,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227765.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"imafoxx","Id":227765,"Name":"imafoxx","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dc031f48186bf7cc7afa1a248bb5eede","RawContent":"My FI and I just decided that we are going to elope to Vegas sometime next year (2011)!! I&#039;m so excited because neither of us have been to the city but we&#039;ve joked about getting married there since we met so it seems perfect for us! \n \n I am so happy i found this thread! &amp;lt;3","Attachments":[],"Id":1143408,"PostDate":1273385175,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My FI and I just decided that we are going to elope to Vegas sometime next year (2011)!! I'm so excited because neither of us have been to the city but we've joked about getting married there since we met so it seems perfect for us! <br \/> <br \/> I am so happy i found this thread! <3\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wn5TWJE\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...WJE\/weight.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"amy.crable@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1273314107,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228002.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"elopingbride11","Id":228002,"Name":"elopingbride11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22b5dbc5a0c02d5c12fda48528982397","RawContent":"all my cousins married in vegas and they all said it was a blast!","Attachments":[],"Id":1154929,"PostDate":1274256525,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                all my cousins married in vegas and they all said it was a blast!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marifepagan@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1274209215,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228325.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"orionandmari072510","Id":228325,"Name":"orionandmari072510","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"419b995dc5b834ec4c7e20400fd51b9b","RawContent":"Hi there! I am getting married September 8, 2011 in the Juno Garden at Caesars Palace. We looked at Mandalay Bay but the prices seemed to be too expensive for what you get. We have booked the ceremony so far and are researching limos and an in-suite reception. I think we are going to order catering and have a reception in a Vista Suite at Mandalay Bay. If anybody has any great suggestions in regards to catering, limos, etc. please feel free to share!","Attachments":[],"Id":1157205,"PostDate":1274393652,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi there! I am getting married September 8, 2011 in the Juno Garden at Caesars Palace. We looked at Mandalay Bay but the prices seemed to be too expensive for what you get. We have booked the ceremony so far and are researching limos and an in-suite reception. I think we are going to order catering and have a reception in a Vista Suite at Mandalay Bay. If anybody has any great suggestions in regards to catering, limos, etc. please feel free to share!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"paquette07@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1274316862,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228375.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cptrex","Id":228375,"Name":"Cptrex","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bee55b2f198968320116545b8f81ab37","RawContent":"hi all\n i&#039;m getting married at the silver chapel @mandalay bay on sept 1st 2011.\n i cant belive i found this forum its great!!!\n our wedding feels like a life time away but i&#039;m sure it will fly in.\n we&#039;ve been to vegas twice and loved it but this time we will be bringing our children so it will be a different experience.\n we still have not decided what to do after the ceremony for dinner as we dont know how many guests we will have(prob 20-30) but i&#039;ve seen lots of suggestions on the forum that i&#039;ll keep in mind.\n happy wedding talk\n angela xx","Attachments":[],"Id":1157637,"PostDate":1274407190,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                hi all<br \/> i'm getting married at the silver chapel @mandalay bay on sept 1st 2011.<br \/> i cant belive i found this forum its great!!!<br \/> our wedding feels like a life time away but i'm sure it will fly in.<br \/> we've been to vegas twice and loved it but this time we will be bringing our children so it will be a different experience.<br \/> we still have not decided what to do after the ceremony for dinner as we dont know how many guests we will have(prob 20-30) but i've seen lots of suggestions on the forum that i'll keep in mind.<br \/> happy wedding talk<br \/> angela xx\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angelablack96@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1274398604,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228400.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vegasbride2011","Id":228400,"Name":"vegasbride2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f78d402bc6762cb3fe45d696770e9e1a","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Cptrex&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi there! I am getting married September 8, 2011 in the Juno Garden at Caesars Palace. We looked at Mandalay Bay but the prices seemed to be too expensive for what you get. We have booked the ceremony so far and are researching limos and an in-suite reception. I think we are going to order catering and have a reception in a Vista Suite at Mandalay Bay. If anybody has any great suggestions in regards to catering, limos, etc. please feel free to share!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;welcome and congrads! I was thinking of marrying there as well, have you seen juno gardens yet? It just opened. which package did you choose and are you staying at caesars palace?","Attachments":[],"Id":1159017,"PostDate":1274499197,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Cptrex<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi there! I am getting married September 8, 2011 in the Juno Garden at Caesars Palace. We looked at Mandalay Bay but the prices seemed to be too expensive for what you get. We have booked the ceremony so far and are researching limos and an in-suite reception. I think we are going to order catering and have a reception in a Vista Suite at Mandalay Bay. If anybody has any great suggestions in regards to catering, limos, etc. please feel free to share!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>welcome and congrads! I was thinking of marrying there as well, have you seen juno gardens yet? It just opened. which package did you choose and are you staying at caesars palace?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"germeseh@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1231134772,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/7\/7a\/7a4a19d5_user-12438-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":0,"PhotoHeight":0,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"meseh","Id":213585,"Name":"meseh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39a55dfea56235ad6b5676816c8d35e6","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;elopingbride11&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;My FI and I just decided that we are going to elope to Vegas sometime next year (2011)!! I&#039;m so excited because neither of us have been to the city but we&#039;ve joked about getting married there since we met so it seems perfect for us! \n \n I am so happy i found this thread! &amp;lt;3&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;welcome and congrads! what are your plans for your wedding?","Attachments":[],"Id":1159019,"PostDate":1274499298,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>elopingbride11<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">My FI and I just decided that we are going to elope to Vegas sometime next year (2011)!! I'm so excited because neither of us have been to the city but we've joked about getting married there since we met so it seems perfect for us! <br \/> <br \/> I am so happy i found this thread! <3<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>welcome and congrads! what are your plans for your wedding?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"germeseh@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1231134772,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/7\/7a\/7a4a19d5_user-12438-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":0,"PhotoHeight":0,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"meseh","Id":213585,"Name":"meseh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f76e84539facacbbc7326708eb83cccc","RawContent":"Hello,\n \n my fiance and I are planning to get married in the Grand Canyon in july or august 2011.","Attachments":[],"Id":1185456,"PostDate":1276658561,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello,<br \/> <br \/> my fiance and I are planning to get married in the Grand Canyon in july or august 2011.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"najajacobsen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1276656136,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229212.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cobra","Id":229212,"Name":"Cobra","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"28c978183b65f7733f374fe284a1d6e3","RawContent":"Hi ladies,\n \n Thank you for all the great information thus far! You have all been so helpful in my early planning stage. I am so excited about planning a Vegas wedding but everything looks so amazing. \n \n How did you guys ultimately decide where to have your ceremony\/reception\/party? Was it mostly cost?\n \n We are looking at getting married July 2011.","Attachments":[],"Id":1187052,"PostDate":1276753695,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n   