{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1dd7f32bfefaa4c1a7687fe27413eabb","RawContent":"Hello Every One\n \n I am getting Married October 10 2010 in Las Vegas, at the Pahrump winery. I have the ceremony all figured out, but I am trying to figure out what to do for the reception, and Maggiano&#039;s is already booked. Does any one have any suggestions of a resturant on the strip, that is not very expensive, but nice. and has private rooms for a reception dinner? Any suggestions would be great.","Attachments":[],"Id":1010254,"PostDate":1264472573,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello Every One<br \/> <br \/> I am getting Married October 10 2010 in Las Vegas, at the Pahrump winery. I have the ceremony all figured out, but I am trying to figure out what to do for the reception, and Maggiano's is already booked. Does any one have any suggestions of a resturant on the strip, that is not very expensive, but nice. and has private rooms for a reception dinner? Any suggestions would be great.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hunny112@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1248480146,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219783.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hunny112","Id":219783,"Name":"hunny112","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"574b817ccc5bb216d3c5f2e5daf79c26","RawContent":"I&#039;m having the same issue! Ceremony is all planned don&#039;t know where to have dinner. Planning to stay at TI or Mirage so we&#039;re looking into BB King&#039;s restaurant. Good luck finding a reception location.","Attachments":[],"Id":1013369,"PostDate":1264644209,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm having the same issue! Ceremony is all planned don't know where to have dinner. Planning to stay at TI or Mirage so we're looking into BB King's restaurant. Good luck finding a reception location.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;6\/st\/20110507\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/ab40\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...ab40\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"shaytwon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1259716496,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223651.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Shay","Id":223651,"Name":"Shay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d5101b3472bf78c1b074452efb6dc17e","RawContent":"hello - we would like to get married in Vegas in Spring 2011 - we are looking at Ceasers Palace, the Bellagio and the Wynn - do you have major pros or cons for any of them?","Attachments":[],"Id":1031652,"PostDate":1265943416,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                hello - we would like to get married in Vegas in Spring 2011 - we are looking at Ceasers Palace, the Bellagio and the Wynn - do you have major pros or cons for any of them?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristyselinger@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"208.181.106.251","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1265780651,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225490.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristy Selinger","Id":225490,"Name":"Kristy Selinger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0ce09e0cc601859f3f211ad717a2d776","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Shay&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I&#039;m having the same issue! Ceremony is all planned don&#039;t know where to have dinner. Planning to stay at TI or Mirage so we&#039;re looking into BB King&#039;s restaurant. Good luck finding a reception location.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Hiya. I am in the same situation as you lovely lot with regards to the reception venue!! \n \n I&#039;m staying at The Mirage, getting married at Little Church (or chapel - can&#039;t remember) of the West. We looked into having our dinner at BB Kings but decided against it as we have been to BB Kings in Orlando and remember the noise level being quite high (which is good if you want to party). We have decided to go to BB Kings after the dinner to dance the night away!! \n \n Shay - please see attached information that they sent to me, incase you haven&#039;t got anything yet.\n If you like BB Kings, then House of Blues is another option. \n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/attachment.php?s=dfbfb5df2e227e10a1ec66dacd051e68&amp;amp;attachmentid=4632\"&gt;Attachment 4632&lt;\/a&gt; Can you tell me if you can open the attachment - bit of a technophobe!! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/what.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"What\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n I am looking for somewhere with a good atmosphere, good food and good prices!!! We will have a party of about 25 so do not need a separate dining area - I think that might make it all a bit too formal anyway and I want everyone to relax and enjoy.&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;6906&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;BB King&#039;s LAS VEGAS Event Packet 2009.pdf&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:803.3291015625,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;pdf&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1036997,"PostDate":1266355412,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Shay<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I'm having the same issue! Ceremony is all planned don't know where to have dinner. Planning to stay at TI or Mirage so we're looking into BB King's restaurant. Good luck finding a reception location.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Hiya. I am in the same situation as you lovely lot with regards to the reception venue!! <br \/> <br \/> I'm staying at The Mirage, getting married at Little Church (or chapel - can't remember) of the West. We looked into having our dinner at BB Kings but decided against it as we have been to BB Kings in Orlando and remember the noise level being quite high (which is good if you want to party). We have decided to go to BB Kings after the dinner to dance the night away!! <br \/> <br \/> Shay - please see attached information that they sent to me, incase you haven't got anything yet.<br \/> If you like BB Kings, then House of Blues is another option. <br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/attachment.php?s=dfbfb5df2e227e10a1ec66dacd051e68&attachmentid=4632' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Attachment 4632<\/a> Can you tell me if you can open the attachment - bit of a technophobe!! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/what.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"What\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I am looking for somewhere with a good atmosphere, good food and good prices!!! We will have a party of about 25 so do not need a separate dining area - I think that might make it all a bit too formal anyway and I want everyone to relax and enjoy.<p>\u00a0<\/p><span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"6906\",\"name\":\"BB King&#039;s LAS VEGAS Event Packet 2009.pdf\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":803.3291015625,\"type\":\"pdf\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;116\/st\/20100923\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/5\/k\/8f78\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...8f78\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"princess_piggysam@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1265735210,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225461.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"PRINCESS P","Id":225461,"Name":"PRINCESS P","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c1a09abc9aa84de834e97866e6644c5c","RawContent":"So jealous of you girls! i wanted to get married in Vegas for the longest time...but FI just wouldn&#039;t go for it, even though i wanted to do a reception and everything...so Jamaica it is! I think we chose the next best place :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1037578,"PostDate":1266369314,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So jealous of you girls! i wanted to get married in Vegas for the longest time...but FI just wouldn't go for it, even though i wanted to do a reception and everything...so Jamaica it is! I think we chose the next best place <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/global.thebump.com\/tickers\/tt7a388.aspx\">http:\/\/global.thebump.com\/tickers\/tt7a388.aspx<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i964.photobucket.com\/albums\/ae129\/mccrady\/gartrepic.jpg\">http:\/\/i964.photobucket.com\/albums\/a...\/gartrepic.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kerrij@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1250884128,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220796.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kerrij","Id":220796,"Name":"kerrij","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a70cda6ab90eb3b969b49015f1bc3654","RawContent":"KerriJ\n \n I&#039;ve never been to Jamaica, but I bet it will be lovely. What sort of wedding are you having .............. is it going to be on the beach??","Attachments":[],"Id":1038723,"PostDate":1266419752,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                KerriJ<br \/> <br \/> I've never been to Jamaica, but I bet it will be lovely. What sort of wedding are you having .............. is it going to be on the beach??\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;116\/st\/20100923\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/5\/k\/8f78\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...8f78\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"princess_piggysam@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1265735210,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225461.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"PRINCESS P","Id":225461,"Name":"PRINCESS P","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c6985bfb4312e16dd813478a0cfc5b7","RawContent":"Ahhh, funny how you look at things KeriJ I would love to get married in Jamica, but it didnt work for all my family to take a whole week off to travel, so we picked vegas instead because it was easy. I hope your wedding is fantastic!","Attachments":[],"Id":1039879,"PostDate":1266468992,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ahhh, funny how you look at things KeriJ I would love to get married in Jamica, but it didnt work for all my family to take a whole week off to travel, so we picked vegas instead because it was easy. I hope your wedding is fantastic!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hunny112@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1248480146,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219783.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hunny112","Id":219783,"Name":"hunny112","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6dedfdf418c72605f2121ad203b061cf","RawContent":"I&#039;m getting married in Vegas in October 2010, we are considering the Hofbrauhaus Biergarten for our reception. Does anyone have any information about the food and price. It would be greatly appreciated.\n \n Thanks Everyone.","Attachments":[],"Id":1078624,"PostDate":1268806078,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm getting married in Vegas in October 2010, we are considering the Hofbrauhaus Biergarten for our reception. Does anyone have any information about the food and price. It would be greatly appreciated.<br \/> <br \/> Thanks Everyone.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pcsmith25@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1268724806,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226483.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"charvn","Id":226483,"Name":"charvn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b6b8c6307f17d750d96fa030e0d692d8","RawContent":"I&#039;m getting married in Vegas the end of July. Looking at Caesars, Wynn, or Mandalay Bay. I wish there was more info on the beach wedding at MB....that would be my #1 choice!","Attachments":[],"Id":1087005,"PostDate":1269414012,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm getting married in Vegas the end of July. Looking at Caesars, Wynn, or Mandalay Bay. I wish there was more info on the beach wedding at MB....that would be my #1 choice!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megn_h@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1269060502,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226596.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"megn_h","Id":226596,"Name":"megn_h","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e1e497e7506bfc2099c5c296ddb0d2be","RawContent":"I got married at Mandalay Bay in October and had originally planned to get married outside by the waterfall area, but decided during a planning trip that it was too loud with the waterfalls and traffic on the street. \n \n I am not sure about the beach wedding but their pool area is usually pretty busy during the summer, so I&#039;m not sure how they would keep people from watching or being near the ceremony. \n \n I worked with Alyssa and she was very helpful through the whole process, I bet if you just call them they can get you more info on how they do the beach weddings. I believe Mandalay Bay was the best deal for the money that I found at any of the hotels.\n \n Hope this helps!\n Amy","Attachments":[],"Id":1095169,"PostDate":1269976476,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I got married at Mandalay Bay in October and had originally planned to get married outside by the waterfall area, but decided during a planning trip that it was too loud with the waterfalls and traffic on the street. <br \/> <br \/> I am not sure about the beach wedding but their pool area is usually pretty busy during the summer, so I'm not sure how they would keep people from watching or being near the ceremony. <br \/> <br \/> I worked with Alyssa and she was very helpful through the whole process, I bet if you just call them they can get you more info on how they do the beach weddings. I believe Mandalay Bay was the best deal for the money that I found at any of the hotels.<br \/> <br \/> Hope this helps!<br \/> Amy\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"soontobeadams@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1230946755,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213510.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"soontobemrsadams","Id":213510,"Name":"soontobemrsadams","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":146,"TotalPages":15,"CurrentPage":100,"NextPage":110,"PreviousPage":90,"LastPage":140},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
