{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7855d2609628eba653158e71cedf88f2","RawContent":"or other parts of Southern Nevada. \n \n Hello Brides (and Grooms):\n \n I want to introduce myself to all our Nevada Brides. My husband and I were married in Napa Valley in July of 2007 and are both from Northern Nevada. We lived in Las Vegas before we got married also.\n \n Please let me know if you have any questions or problems with this area of the forum. \n Also if you feel that you are being soliticted by a vendor please let me know.\n \n If you will please introduce yourself on this thread as a Vegas bride (or groom) with your wedding location and wedding date so that we can all get to know each other.\n \n Happy Planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":496591,"PostDate":1225516063,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                or other parts of Southern Nevada. <br \/> <br \/> Hello Brides (and Grooms):<br \/> <br \/> I want to introduce myself to all our Nevada Brides. My husband and I were married in Napa Valley in July of 2007 and are both from Northern Nevada. We lived in Las Vegas before we got married also.<br \/> <br \/> Please let me know if you have any questions or problems with this area of the forum. <br \/> Also if you feel that you are being soliticted by a vendor please let me know.<br \/> <br \/> If you will please introduce yourself on this thread as a Vegas bride (or groom) with your wedding location and wedding date so that we can all get to know each other.<br \/> <br \/> Happy Planning!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<strong>Christine + Will (married 7\/20\/07) + Ainsleigh (born 6\/25\/08) + Nolan (born 11\/9\/10) + Delaney (born 12\/31\/13) = One Very Happy Family!<\/strong>","Email":"christine@dc-hulls.com","IpAddress":"167.154.70.240","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1165989180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206965.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Christine","Id":206965,"Name":"Christine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d013bdaa68c77b74bbbda5df375a25fd","RawContent":"I will be getting married in Las Vegas - July 28, 2009. I have not booked yet but plan to get married at the Chapel of the Flowers. I am excited because I just started on my DIY save the date boarding passes!!! I am ready now.","Attachments":[],"Id":501548,"PostDate":1225961259,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I will be getting married in Las Vegas - July 28, 2009. I have not booked yet but plan to get married at the Chapel of the Flowers. I am excited because I just started on my DIY save the date boarding passes!!! I am ready now.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10743;133\/st\/20090721\/e\/Our+Vegas+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/021c\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...021c\/event.png<\/a><br><br><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\/michaelandnicole\">http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\/michaelandnicole<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"nicmicj@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1222505295,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211973.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nicmicj","Id":211973,"Name":"nicmicj","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2c835c12a18a3cff7845cd50840d3b68","RawContent":"I&#039;m getting married in LAS VEGAS!!!! I&#039;ve been to vegas about 10 times or so..maybe more. I absolutely love this city!! We&#039;re getting married at the classico chapel in Caesar&#039;s Palace. We originally wanted the garden but when we realized how hot it is during September (It was 97 everyday we were there!) we changed it to the indoor chapel so we wouldn&#039;t have sweat beads on our foreheads as we say &amp;quot;I DO&amp;quot;. We&#039;re then taking our 50-75 guests to Joe&#039;s Steak &amp;amp; Seafood located in the new entrance of the Forum Shops. They have a beautiful private dinning room and the food is absolutely fabulous!! Afterwards we want to shuttle everyone over to New York, New York to the Bar at Times Square to enjoy a night of dueling piano&#039;s. Considering using outside vendor for flowers since Caesar&#039;s is quite pricy but its still early so I haven&#039;t looked into that alot. Also if you have any ideas for cheap group activities I&#039;d love to hear them. Any feedback tho is greatly apprciated it. Always great to have a second opinion!","Attachments":[],"Id":511344,"PostDate":1226967354,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm getting married in LAS VEGAS!!!! I've been to vegas about 10 times or so..maybe more. I absolutely love this city!! We're getting married at the classico chapel in Caesar's Palace. We originally wanted the garden but when we realized how hot it is during September (It was 97 everyday we were there!) we changed it to the indoor chapel so we wouldn't have sweat beads on our foreheads as we say \"I DO\". We're then taking our 50-75 guests to Joe's Steak & Seafood located in the new entrance of the Forum Shops. They have a beautiful private dinning room and the food is absolutely fabulous!! Afterwards we want to shuttle everyone over to New York, New York to the Bar at Times Square to enjoy a night of dueling piano's. Considering using outside vendor for flowers since Caesar's is quite pricy but its still early so I haven't looked into that alot. Also if you have any ideas for cheap group activities I'd love to hear them. Any feedback tho is greatly apprciated it. Always great to have a second opinion!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"canadianheather@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1226355365,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212620.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"canadianheather","Id":212620,"Name":"canadianheather","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c77f2d8ddd331ba3ea9a4904e84778f3","RawContent":"sounds like you have a lot planned. I don&#039;t know of any florists but if you browse around this area of the forum I think you will find some vendor suggestions. \n Welcome to BDW!","Attachments":[],"Id":511350,"PostDate":1226967592,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                sounds like you have a lot planned. I don't know of any florists but if you browse around this area of the forum I think you will find some vendor suggestions. <br \/> Welcome to BDW!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<strong>Christine + Will (married 7\/20\/07) + Ainsleigh (born 6\/25\/08) + Nolan (born 11\/9\/10) + Delaney (born 12\/31\/13) = One Very Happy Family!<\/strong>","Email":"christine@dc-hulls.com","IpAddress":"167.154.70.240","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1165989180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206965.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Christine","Id":206965,"Name":"Christine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"525e87fbd499ccc477a0004db2ef9cf4","RawContent":"Hi! \n \n I am getting married in Las Vegas in September 2009. We haven&#039;t book anything yet but we are thinking of Ceasars Palace. We aren&#039;t sure what to do for a reception\/dinner so any suggestions are welcome!! I look forward to getting to know everyone through out the planning process!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":531919,"PostDate":1229030628,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi! <br \/> <br \/> I am getting married in Las Vegas in September 2009. We haven't book anything yet but we are thinking of Ceasars Palace. We aren't sure what to do for a reception\/dinner so any suggestions are welcome!! I look forward to getting to know everyone through out the planning process!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cmbeck@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1228951507,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213108.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"myturn","Id":213108,"Name":"myturn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e53538e5833c1568bb421578c450671d","RawContent":"welcome to the Vegas area of the forum. I believe I posted some photos of the Ceasars chapel. \n Browse around this area of the forum for what a bunch of the other brides are doing for dinner. \n Some have decided to go to buffets, resturaunts and some are even doing receptions in their suites.","Attachments":[],"Id":532434,"PostDate":1229062833,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                welcome to the Vegas area of the forum. I believe I posted some photos of the Ceasars chapel. <br \/> Browse around this area of the forum for what a bunch of the other brides are doing for dinner. <br \/> Some have decided to go to buffets, resturaunts and some are even doing receptions in their suites.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<strong>Christine + Will (married 7\/20\/07) + Ainsleigh (born 6\/25\/08) + Nolan (born 11\/9\/10) + Delaney (born 12\/31\/13) = One Very Happy Family!<\/strong>","Email":"christine@dc-hulls.com","IpAddress":"167.154.70.240","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1165989180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206965.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Christine","Id":206965,"Name":"Christine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca2c588c2f61c0f160b259bbb705f916","RawContent":"I&#039;m getting married in May 2009 in Vegas. I have a lot left to plan as I have the laziest fiancee around but as soon as I get some things confirmed I&#039;ll be sure to share them with BDW.","Attachments":[],"Id":532458,"PostDate":1229067979,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm getting married in May 2009 in Vegas. I have a lot left to plan as I have the laziest fiancee around but as soon as I get some things confirmed I'll be sure to share them with BDW.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i35.tinypic.com\/1076iaf.jpg\">http:\/\/i35.tinypic.com\/1076iaf.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1202\/1007\/20090919\/Our+Wedding%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1202\/...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/foxybrides-extremely-detailed-las-vegas-wedding-review-49821\/\">FoxyBride's Las Vegas Wedding Review Thread<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/foxybrides-past-due-planning-thread-49781\/\">FoxyBride's Las Vegas Planning Thread<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"alfox@umich.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1221389100,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211713.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":81,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FoxyBride","Id":211713,"Name":"FoxyBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9f6d2984869bf96ad102629fc34f75fa","RawContent":"Hi my name is Meseh and I plan to marry in Vegas in the fall. I&#039;m thinking about marrying at ceasar&#039;s palace in the venus gardent or at the flamingo in one of there outdoor locations. It may be a total of 8-10 of us including myself and my fiance. what about you?","Attachments":[],"Id":548626,"PostDate":1231142853,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi my name is Meseh and I plan to marry in Vegas in the fall. I'm thinking about marrying at ceasar's palace in the venus gardent or at the flamingo in one of there outdoor locations. It may be a total of 8-10 of us including myself and my fiance. what about you?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"germeseh@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1231134772,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/7\/7a\/7a4a19d5_user-12438-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":0,"PhotoHeight":0,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"meseh","Id":213585,"Name":"meseh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b98e45e334a01b308b13c5533d7ca6ec","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;meseh&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi my name is Meseh and I plan to marry in Vegas in the fall. I&#039;m thinking about marrying at ceasar&#039;s palace in the venus gardent or at the flamingo in one of there outdoor locations. It may be a total of 8-10 of us including myself and my fiance. what about you?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Hi Meseh, I booked the venus gardens at Caesars Palace for September and I just was in Vegas to meet with people and to look at possible places for the reception. The people at Caesars palace were awesome to deal with and the garden is very pretty and quite private. I haven&#039;t seen the flamingo so I can&#039;t comment on their locations.","Attachments":[],"Id":552420,"PostDate":1231372170,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>meseh<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi my name is Meseh and I plan to marry in Vegas in the fall. I'm thinking about marrying at ceasar's palace in the venus gardent or at the flamingo in one of there outdoor locations. It may be a total of 8-10 of us including myself and my fiance. what about you?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Hi Meseh, I booked the venus gardens at Caesars Palace for September and I just was in Vegas to meet with people and to look at possible places for the reception. The people at Caesars palace were awesome to deal with and the garden is very pretty and quite private. I haven't seen the flamingo so I can't comment on their locations.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cmbeck@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1228951507,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213108.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"myturn","Id":213108,"Name":"myturn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":26001,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"715e841413fb386468e548e78a39eb8b","RawContent":"Oh, ok. how many people will be joining you in Vegas for your wedding?","Attachments":[],"Id":553353,"PostDate":1231419057,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Oh, ok. how many people will be joining you in Vegas for your wedding?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"germeseh@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1231134772,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/7\/7a\/7a4a19d5_user-12438-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":0,"PhotoHeight":0,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"meseh","Id":213585,"Name":"meseh","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":146,"TotalPages":15,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":140},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
